		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blue-skinned, three-eyed ice ogres that live amongst frost giants. Loves fistfights.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (1d6) or 1 spell +5, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fade (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Self. Become invisible for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ice Dart (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One target in far takes 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapeshift</strong>. In place of attacks, turn into any humanoid or back into original form.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stagger</strong>. If oni hits the same target with two or more slams, CON 15+ or stunned 1 round.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
